From: dotlouis <1891109+dotlouis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 16:37:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 04/41] MTROPOLIS: Implement Hoologic bitmap variable, capture,
 display and scale

Implement the Hoologic Bitmap Suite modifiers needed by Uncle Albert's
Fabulous Voyage to draw and animate the pages of its notebook:

- Bitmap Variable stores a bitmap. Its "object" attribute resolves to
  the variable itself, and assigning one bitmap variable to another
  copies the bitmap, which is how the game keeps copies of pages.
- Capture Bitmap copies the screen area of its parent element into a
  bitmap variable.
- Display Bitmap draws the current contents of a bitmap variable in
  place of its parent element, until its remove event.
- Scale Bitmap resizes a bitmap variable to the point it receives.

Visual elements get an optional display bitmap source that graphic and
image elements draw instead of their own contents. The data fields of
these modifiers are renamed after what they turned out to be.

